  The Arabic interface.

  The adhkar headings are here like any other label. What is NOT here is the
  adhkar themselves — they live in assets/adhkar/*.tsv, are Qur'an and hadith,
  and exist in one language only, so there is nothing to translate. The two
  language names (lang_english, lang_arabic) fall through to values/ instead:
  each is written in its own language on both sides of the switch.
-->
